<title>JAPAN: Nitchitsu - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nitchitsu - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.63		vs	    6.18</p>
<p> Operating	  383    million    vs	  316    million</p>
<p> Current	    291    million    vs	  218    million</p>
<p> Net		  159    million    vs	  127    million</p>
<p> EPS		    7.26 yen	  vs	    5.78 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     22 million	  vs	  22 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nitchitsu Co Ltd is a manufacturer of land based machinery, such as air heaters.</p>
